{"id":"dicho","lemma":"dicho","pos":"noun","rank":183,"glosses":["saying, expression","remark","proverb"],"ipa":"/ˈdit͡ʃo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dichos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-dicho.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es tu dicho favorito?","en":"What's your favorite saying?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522426","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"favorite/favourite"}]},{"text":"¿Has dicho que yo no podría ganar nunca?","en":"Did you say that I could never win?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609574","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to gain"},{"g":"never"}]},{"text":"¿Has entendido lo que te ha dicho?","en":"Do you understand what he's told you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734725","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"expert"},null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"¡Siempre tiene dichos tan agudos!","en":"He's always making such witty remarks!","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"sharp, pointed, acute","l":"agudo"}]},{"text":"Ya me lo habían dicho.","en":"They already told me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532650","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]}]}